占到员工总数近三分之一，裁员理由是AI判断他们不敬业、效率低下。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;内部邮件显示，Xsolla的CEO阿加皮托夫表示，裁员的依据是通过大数据分析了员工在工作聊天、邮件和其他服务中的活动。&lt;br&gt;需要注意的是，此前有媒体报道称，亚马逊被曝使用AI监控员工工作效率，并根据休息时间自动下达裁员命令，而无需人工介入。</p>","excerpt":"据媒体报道，近日，俄罗斯在线支付服务公…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":9,"created":1629181657,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1410970816191983616"},{"id":"1410622552682823680","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-4a9abaa4cb8caf9313acebe7183544cc_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"2013\" height=\"1050\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":25,"created":1629098624,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1410622552682823680"},{"id":"1410269000462540800","title":"看不懂","content":"<p>看不懂</p><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-c115dbb8b4a4df3ee0cc0ed9344aa9c7_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"801\" height=\"556\">","excerpt":"看不懂","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":7,"created":1629014331,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1410269000462540800"},{"id":"1409844099877281792","title":"我看不懂，但大为震撼","content":"<p>我看不懂，但大为震撼。</p><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-058adb88491adc4e0c235724515c79db_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"420\" height=\"70\">","excerpt":"我看不懂，但大为震撼","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":67,"created":1628913027,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1409844099877281792"},{"id":"1409481945273765888","title":"群臣吏民能面刺寡人之过者，受上赏；上书…","content":"<p>群臣吏民能面刺寡人之过者，受上赏；上书谏寡人者，受中赏；能谤讥于闹市，闻寡人之耳者，受下赏。</p>","excerpt":"群臣吏民能面刺寡人之过者，受上赏；上书…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":32,"created":1628826682,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1409481945273765888"}]}